  "The RED line is the thimble edge. The ARROW is the last sleeve line it has passed — that is the MSR.": "红线是微分筒的边缘，箭头指的是它已经越过的最后一条套筒刻线 — 那就是 MSR。",
  "The long line running down the sleeve is the datum. Exactly one thimble division is level with it; its neighbours sit above and below. Being one division out is the commonest micrometer misread — check both sides before you commit.": "沿套筒纵向的那条长线就是基准线。有且只有一格微分筒刻线与之齐平，它两侧的刻线分别偏上、偏下。差一格是测微器最常见的误读 — 下结论前先把两侧都看清。",
  "You do not count from zero on a micrometer. ": "测微器上不是从零开始数的。",
  "This micrometer has a zero error of ": "这把测微器的零误差是 ",
  "Here the datum lands exactly on the numbered line ": "这里基准线正好落在标数字的那条线上 ",
  "Take the nearest NUMBERED graduation — ": "取最近的、标有数字的刻线 — ",
  " from it to the datum: CSR = ": " 数到基准线的格数：CSR = ",
  " straight off the drum.": "，直接从微分筒上读出。",
  "The lower box is CSR × LC — ": "下面的方框是 CSR × LC — ",
  "step 0 divisions from it": "距它 0 格",
  "level with the line": "与基准线齐平",
  "read the last number the thimble covers": "读微分筒盖住的最后一个数字",
  "Lines ABOVE the datum are whole millimetres, lines BELOW it are the half-millimetres. Missing one is the classic 0.5 mm error.": "基准线<strong>上方</strong>的刻线是整毫米，<strong>下方</strong>的刻线是半毫米。漏看一条就是那个经典的 0.5 mm 错误。",
  "Every sleeve line here is a whole millimetre — this screw has no half-millimetre mark to miss.": "这种套筒上每条刻线都是整毫米 — 螺距 1 mm 的测微器压根没有半毫米刻线可漏。",
  "Each sleeve line is 0.025 in; every fourth is numbered in tenths.": "套筒每格 0.025 in，每第 4 格按十分之一英寸标注数字。",
  "The sleeve is numbered backwards and the thimble COVERS it as the reading grows, so the MSR is the last number the thimble has hidden.": "套筒是反向标注的，而且读数越大微分筒盖得越多，所以 MSR 是微分筒已经盖住的那个数字。",
